<p>(*) NeuronRain Green - <a href="https://github.com/shrinivaasanka" class="uri">https://github.com/shrinivaasanka</a> - generic datasets</p>
<blockquote>
<p>(*) NeuronRain Antariksh - <a href="https://gitlab.com/shrinivaasanka" class="uri">https://gitlab.com/shrinivaasanka</a> - Drone development</p>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
