          "email": "ksrinivasan@krishna-iresearch.org"
        },
        "message": "1668. (THEORY and FEATURE) Software Analytics - Kernel Analytics and Scheduler Analytics - Enhanced Berkeley Packet Filter (eBPF) Observability - runqlat and runqlen added to bpftrace script - related to 561,1191,619,770,906,911,771,1192,1443,1459,1488 and all sections on Program Analysis, AsFer-USBmd-VIRGO-KingCobra FTrace kernel callgraph analysis - Valgrind-Callgrind-KCacheGrind-Flamegraph userspace callgraph analysis, SATURN control flow analysis of VIRGO linux kernel, Software Analytics, Pandemic model of Botnet-Defense adversarial Game theoretic security, Cybercrime analytics, Anti-Malware,Anti-Ransomware,Anti-Theft and Anti-Plagiarism tools, KML, LAKE,Intrusion Prevention-Detection Systems(IDS and IPS),Anomaly Detection - 4 June 2026",
