        "message": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1672. (THEORY and FEATURE) OS Scheduling and Hashing Dynamic Sets - Python 3.13 implementation of Survival Index Deadline Scheduler - SCHED_DEADLINE chrt timeout arguments from os.environ() shell variables - related to 751,1354,1357,1477 and all sections on Set partitions, Computational geometry, Program analysis/Software analytics/Scheduler Analytics among other topics in NeuronRain Theory Drafts, Sun Microsystems-Oracle-Global Analytics Patent Disclosures and Timeout implementations, Machine Learning enabled VIRGO Linux Kernel for Massive Datasets on Cloud - 25 June 2026\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1672.1 course_material/Programming/Python/code/SurvivalIndexScheduler.py has been updated to print timedout processes when countdown survival index clockticks reach 0. Instead of print, the timedout processes could be killed in userspace which simulates a timeout scheduler in userspace.\n1672.2 Exception is printed without continue to enforce virgo_kernel_analytics.conf write always even in exceptions. Scheduler policy is printed (Timeslice=TS or Deadline=DLN)\n1672.3 Three shell variables DEADLINE,RUNTIME and PERIOD are read from os.environ() instead of hardcoded chrt SCHED_DEADLINE EDF values earlier.\n1672.4 Switch interval has been made finer to 0.01 to enforce frequent thread context switches.\n1672.5 AsyncIO code has been commented as earlier due to inconsistencies in asynchronous execution.\n1672.6 code/virgo_kernel_analytics.conf which is read by VIRGO Linux kernel_analytics driver shows lot of timeslice(TS) processes and only few deadline(DLN) processes though all of them were spawned by chrt SCHED_DEADLINE policy.\n1672.7 Excerpts of logs are written to code/logs/SurvivalIndexScheduler.log.25June2026",
        "tree": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/Grafit/git/trees/1343d1b123830656ec8b7bdc17d8e843c7782367",
          "sha": "1343d1b123830656ec8b7bdc17d8e843c7782367"
        },
