          "email": "ka.shrinivaasan@gmail.com"
        },
        "message": "1667. (THEORY and FEATURE) Social Network Analysis - Additional settings for PIPL analytics and revised prompt for AI people analytics by OpenAI - related to 14,365,626,711,727,753,876,1127,1128,1129,1130,1204,1263,1269,1427,1442,1452,1532,1534,1547,1555,1571,1592,1605,1645,1657 and all sections on People Analytics, Intrinsic Merit Versus Fame Equilibrium, BKS Conjecture, Stability and Noise Sensitivity of Interview LTF/PTF,Peres Theorem,Unique Identification,Talent Analytics,Code search of opensource repositories,HR Analytics and Automated Recruitment,Question-Answering,Majority Voting,Condorcet Jury Theorem Variants,Margulis-Ruzzo Thresholds,Novelty Detection,Recommender Systems,AI Question-Answering, Partial Ordered Ranking, Fame-Merit equilibrium, Intrinsic Merit as Query Complexity,Software Analytics-Mythical Manmonth-CathedralAndBazaar,Birthday Paradox,Matching in Matrimony-Professional-Personal Social Media Network Profiles,Tree matching - 31 May 2026",
