        "message": "1644. (THEORY and FEATURE) Time series analysis - Least Squares Curve Fit for timeseries - related to 690,691,692,1257,1315,1316,1327,1348,1367,1375,1376,1436,1437,1438,1489 and all sections on Computational Economics-Quantitative Finance and TimeSeries Analysis, Graphical Event Models (GEM), Causal Event Models (CEM), Chain Event Graphs(CEG), Chaos and Fractals, EventNet causality, Multifractal Detrended Fluctuation Analysis (MFDFA),Fame-Merit in the context of quantitative finance - 20 November 2025",
