   "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                2435,\n                2442\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                2548,\n                2555\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                2669,\n                2676\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                2806,\n                2813\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                2939,\n                2946\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3120,\n                3127\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3269,\n                3276\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3410,\n                3417\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3549,\n                3556\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3698,\n                3705\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3841,\n                3848\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                3990,\n                3997\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4140,\n                4147\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4279,\n                4286\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4424,\n                4431\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4569,\n                4576\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4775,\n                4782\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                4951,\n                4958\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "FEATURE",\n              "indices": [\n                5142,\n                5149\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "text": "and",\n              "indices": [\n                5288,\n                5291\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/4710d675f1695f17c8b28e9ef3fafae266f3180a",\n      "sha": "4710d675f1695f17c8b28e9ef3fafae266f3180a",\n      "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0MzY5NDUyNzI6NDcxMGQ2NzVmMTY5NWYxN2M4YjI4ZTllZjNmYWZhZTI2NmYzMTgwYQ==",\n      "html_url": "https://github.com/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commit/4710d675f1695f17c8b28e9ef3fafae266f3180a",\n      "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/4710d675f1695f17c8b28e9ef3fafae266f3180a/comments",\n      "commit": {\n        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/git/commits/4710d675f1695f17c8b28e9ef3fafae266f3180a",\n        "author": {\n          "date": "2025-03-26T16:08:56.000+05:30",\n          "name": "Srinivasan Kannan",\n          "email": "ka.shrinivaasan@gmail.com"\n        },\n        "committer": {\n          "date": "2025-03-26T16:08:56.000+05:30",\n          "name": "Srinivasan Kannan",\n          "email": "ka.shrinivaasan@gmail.com"\n        },\n        "message": "-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n1592. (THEORY and FEATURE) Social Network Analysis - GitHub code search - GraphQL API - related to 14,365,626,711,727,753,876,1127,1128,1129,1130,1204,1263,1269,1427,1442,1452,1532,1534,1547,1555,1571 and all sections on People Analytics, Intrinsic Merit Versus Fame Equilibrium, BKS Conjecture, Stability and Noise Sensitivity of Interview LTF/PTF,Peres Theorem,Unique Identification,Talent Analytics,Code search of opensource repositories,HR Analytics and Automated Recruitment,Question-Answering,Majority Voting,Condorcet Jury Theorem Variants,Margulis-Ruzzo Thresholds,Novelty Detection,Recommender Systems,AI Question-Answering, Partial Ordered Ranking, Fame-Merit equilibrium, Intrinsic Merit as Query Complexity,Software Analytics-Mythical Manmonth-CathedralAndBazaar,Birthday Paradox - 26 March 2025\\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n1592.1 python-src/SocialNetworkAnalysis_PeopleAnalytics.py has been updated to include a CURL commandline to execute GraphQL API queries for GitHub repositories search. So far only REST API CURL requests were supported.\\n1592.2 GraphQL queries are more comprehensive than REST endpoints and require complex JSON templates which are read from a textfile GitHubCodeSearch_GraphQL.txt with TOKEN being the placeholder for access tokens. TOKEN is replaced at runtime by temporary personal access tokens and executed by os.system() instead of os.popen() due to string wrap problem with CURL JSON template POST request strings. In principle, os.system() has to be replaced by subprocess.call(), popen2() - popen3() - popen4() functions in recent python versions or subprocess.check_output() to capture stdout. Actual result of earlier CURL GraphQL query is not printed by os.system() but can be manually checked from commandline execution as:\\n                {\\"data\\":{\\"viewer\\":{\\"login\\":\\"shrinivaasanka\\"}}}\\n1592.3 More information from logs - testlogs/SocialNetworkAnalysis_PeopleAnalytics.log.26March2025\\n~",\n        "tree": {\n          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/git/trees/86f167a00439de219cf80422af8d72fd0481bbb2",\n          "sha": "86f167a00439de219cf80422af8d72fd0481bbb2"\n        },\n        "comment_count": 0\n      },\n      "author": null,\n      "committer": null,\n      "parents": [\n        {\n          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/33c0f49474c8a8c35b00842384f2015467386a24",\n          "html_url": "https://github.com/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commit/33c0f49474c8a8c35b00842384f2015467386a24",\n          "sha": "33c0f49474c8a8c35b00842384f2015467386a24"\n        }\n      ],\n      "repository": {\n        "id": 36945272,\n        "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNjk0NTI3Mg==",\n        "name": "asfer-github-code",\n        "full_name": "shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code",\n        "private": false,\n        "owner": {\n          "login": "shrinivaasanka",\n          "id": 8086981,\n          "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgwODY5ODE=",\n          "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8086981?v=4",\n          "gravatar_id": "",\n          "url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrinivaasanka",\n          "html_url": "https://github.com/shrinivaasanka",\n          "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrinivaasanka/followers",\n          "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrinivaasanka/following{/other_user}",\n          "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrinivaasanka/gists{/gist_id}",\n          "starred_url": "https://api.