s hereby clarified author did not participate in Text Analysis Conference (TAC 2010), November 15 and 16, 2010, Gaithersburg, Maryland, USA in person despite invitation.",\n-          "matches": [\n-            {\n-              "text": "THEORY and FEATURE",\n-              "indices": [\n-                147,\n-                165\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                254,\n-                257\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                346,\n-                349\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                658,\n-                661\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                675,\n-                678\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "shrinivaasanka",\n-              "indices": [\n-                741,\n-                755\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                1168,\n-                1171\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "shrinivaasanka",\n-              "indices": [\n-                1191,\n-                1205\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                1340,\n-                1343\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                1378,\n-                1381\n-              ]\n-            },\n-            {\n-              "text": "and",\n-              "indices": [\n-                1707,\n-                1710\n-              ]\n-            }\n-          ]\n-        }\n-      ]\n-    },\n-    {\n-      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/c56f4a85951d34eb523b3ff9f0346cc1468ef421",\n-      "sha": "c56f4a85951d34eb523b3ff9f0346cc1468ef421",\n-      "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0MzY5NDUyNzI6YzU2ZjRhODU5NTFkMzRlYjUyM2IzZmY5ZjAzNDZjYzE0NjhlZjQyMQ==",\n-      "html_url": "https://github.com/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commit/c56f4a85951d34eb523b3ff9f0346cc1468ef421",\n-      "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/c56f4a85951d34eb523b3ff9f0346cc1468ef421/comments",\n-      "commit": {\n-        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/git/commits/c56f4a85951d34eb523b3ff9f0346cc1468ef421",\n-        "author": {\n-          "date": "2023-09-15T18:51:24.000+05:30",\n-          "name": "Srinivasan Kannan",\n-          "email": "ka.shrinivaasan@gmail.com"\n-        },\n-        "committer": {\n-          "date": "2023-09-15T18:51:24.000+05:30",\n-          "name": "Srinivasan Kannan",\n-          "email": "ka.shrinivaasan@gmail.com"\n-        },\n-        "message": "-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n1452. (THEORY and FEATURE) People Analytics - Social Network Analysis - enhancements to GitHub Code Search REST API statistics and support for regular expression search of repository clones - related to 14,365,626,711,727,753,876,1127,1128,1129,1130,1204,1263,1269,1427,1442 and all sections on People Analytics, Intrinsic Merit Versus Fame Equilibrium, BKS Conjecture, Stability and Noise Sensitivity of Interview LTF/PTF,Peres Theorem,Unique Identification,Talent Analytics,HR Analytics and Automated Recruitment,Question-Answering,Majority Voting,Condorcet Jury Theorem Variants,Margulis-Ruzzo Thresholds,Novelty Detection,Recommender Systems,AI Question-Answering, Partial Ordered Ranking, Fame-Merit equilibrium, Intrinsic Merit as Query Complexity,Software Analytics-Mythical Manmonth-CathedralAndBazaar - 15 September 2023\\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n1452.1 python-src/SocialNetworkAnalysis_PeopleAnalytics.py has been updated to import regular expressions re and sys modules. Function codesearch_statistics(self,opensourceid=None,personalaccesstoken=None,query=None,filepath=None) has been refactored to introduce more arguments (query and filepath) and 3 clauses separately for (*) JSON search results based on \\"opensourceid\\" parameter by REST calls with header: Accept: application/vnd.github+json (*) JSON search results based on a complex text-match from \\"query\\" parameter by REST calls with header: Accept: application/vnd.github.text-match+json (*) plain regular expression search of locally cloned repository file at \\"filepath\\" by \\"query\\" parameter which does not depend on GitHub code search.\\n1452.2 Following are the queries (to search for keyword \\"FEATURE\\") to GitHub codesearch REST API and local clones of NeuronRain repository design text files for 3 clauses implemented above for retrieving all FEATUREs:\\n    codesearchstats=hranal.codesearch_statistics(opensourceid=\\"shrinivaasanka\\",personalaccesstoken=\\"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\\")\\n    codesearchstats1=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"shrinivaasanka+THEORY+and+FEATURE\\",personalaccesstoken=\\"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\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../asfer-docs/AstroInferDesign.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../usb-md64-github-code/USBmd_notes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../virgo64-linux-github-code/virgo-docs/VirgoDesign.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../kingcobra64-github-code/KingCobraDesignNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/ComputerScienceMiscellaneous/ComputerScienceMiscellaneous_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/Python/Python_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/Go/Go_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/C/C_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/C++/CPlusPlus_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/C++/code/namefilter.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/GUI/AngularJS_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/GUI/TypeScript_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/R/R_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/Rust/Rust_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/Programming/Java/Java_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/NeuronRain/AdvancedComputerScienceAndMachineLearning/AdvancedComputerScienceAndMachineLearning.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/NeuronRain/LinuxKernelAndCloud/BigdataAnalyticsCloud_CourseNotes.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/NeuronRain/LinuxKernelAndCloud/code/AdvertisementAnalytics_RecommenderSystemsCF.txt\\")\\n    codesearchstats2=hranal.codesearch_statistics(query=\\"FEATURE\\",filepath=\\"../../Grafit/course_material/NeuronRain/LinuxKernelAndCloud/LinuxKernelAndCloud.txt\\")\\n1452.3 Search results (GitHub codesearch and Regular expression local repository clone search) are in testlogs/SocialNetworkAnalysis_PeopleAnalytics.log.15September2023\\n\\nReferences:\\n----------\\n1452.4 GitHub code search API syntax - https://docs.github.com/en/rest/search?apiVersion=2022-11-28",\n-        "tree": {\n-          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/git/trees/f8797d1e699414cbb90ad4a1ee58e3f293219453",\n-          "sha": "f8797d1e699414cbb90ad4a1ee58e3f293219453"\n-        },\n-        "comment_count": 0\n-      },\n-      "author": null,\n-      "committer": null,\n-      "parents": [\n-        {\n-          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commits/3acf65ba6096a1bb67d0268b63438e607a026f52",\n-          "html_url": "https://github.com/shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code/commit/3acf65ba6096a1bb67d0268b63438e607a026f52",\n-          "sha": "3acf65ba6096a1bb67d0268b63438e607a026f52"\n-        }\n-      ],\n-      "repository": {\n-        "id": 36945272,\n-        "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNjk0NTI3Mg==",\n-        "name": "asfer-github-code",\n-        "full_name": "shrinivaasanka/asfer-github-code",\n-        "private": false,\n-        "owner": {\n-          "login": "shrinivaasanka",\n-          "id": 8086981,\n-          "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgwODY5ODE=",\n-          "avatar_url": "https://